        IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
        PROGRAM-ID. AUNCIENT-FPGA-BEYOND-955.
        ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
        DATA DIVISION.
        WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
        01  WS-FPGA-BEYOND-955-STATE.
            05  WS-TPA-BASE-ADDR            PIC 9(05) VALUE 00256.
            05  WS-TH956-COPROC-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH957-GRAPH-MERKLE-OK    PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH958-TENSOR-LAT-OK      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
            05  WS-TH959-960M-SAAT-OK       PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
